{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:57 2026-10-05 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:57 2026-10-05 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:57 2026-10-05 HKT</p><p>黃大仙下邨龍和樓一單位，今（5日）中午1時19分，60多歲坐輪椅女戶主，發現其69歲丈夫在屋內暈倒昏迷不醒，驚慌大叫救命，驚動保安報警求助。消防員趕至單位，破門入屋，將昏迷男戶主送往廣華醫院，惜最終搶救不治，女戶主亦報稱不適，清醒送院檢查，警方正調查事件。</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4725be21972df3be6e3621d60044b7fb/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_14_13_30.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為黃大仙下邨龍和樓一單位。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7a9d7e6d23dcf3d28ddd14e3e7e6052f/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_14_10_40.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c2c3cf3ec3af4d221153eaa8da10e18/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_14_10_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c82b60751b9f050cbb6a0f4394e5c253/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_14_10_38.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"昏迷男子送往廣華醫院。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b9d7d8a9fa1ed4c2d8cb4f71e4dad05e/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-05_at_14_06_40.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-05T07:19:13.555421+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}